Q38 
  Yours:   FROM orders LEFT JOIN customers ...
  Wrong:   This keeps all ORDERS, so customers with 0 orders disappear, which is the opposite of the question.
           Also, the alias "orderNumber" for a count is confusing.
  Correct: SELECT c.customerNumber, c.customerName, COUNT(o.orderNumber) AS order_count
           FROM customers c
           LEFT JOIN orders o ON o.customerNumber = c.customerNumber
